{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-15_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-15",
  "title": "冬逝",
  "storyCode": "6-17",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-15_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "091b63b91abc6f3e7dc56d60b1c41bde3fcf928c0b734823b5e50e5647cfe5e9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "碎了......嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "老爺子從某個巫師那裡求得這樣東西......說是能維持住我的性命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "連一場戰鬥都沒撐過去，呵呵，終歸，還是假貨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "也許就像我們父女一樣......？和現在的，荒誕的整合運動......也一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "咳，咳......煌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "寒流已經......消散了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我沒事！阿米婭，快，去看看那隻白兔子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "贏得漂亮，羅德島。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "我的兄弟姐妹們......我讓他們白白死去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "我們什麼都沒做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "我的生命......一點價值都沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他們是因為你的理念而追隨你的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我的死......不值得任何人久留。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "去救你們還能救的人吧。趕快。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "快去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "無論是阻止那些穿雨衣的，還是去追殺梅菲斯特，還是收容那些無處可去的感染者......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "去吧。去做有價值的事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "博士......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我留下。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你去吧。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我知道了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "博士，請告訴霜星小姐那句話。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......拜託你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "真是隻......天真的兔子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "很像啊。和當時的塔露拉，很像。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "在死前能看到這樣的人，這樣堅定地去實現理想的人......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "說好的責任呢？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不是答應說要加入羅德島的嗎？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "憑你的頭腦，應該也考慮到這點了吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "壞人也要有壞人該有的樣子。我對自己應得的結局毫無怨言。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我傷害了你們，我和整合運動把目標對準了無辜的龍門人，一手促成了烏薩斯感染者的黑暗未來，這樣的人根本沒資格去羅德島。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我的兄弟姐妹......這些傻子，一定是想著讓我活著吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "本以為哪怕這一次我死去了，這些傻子也能因此得到個允許他們活下去的地方。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "沒有，並沒有。他們死了。為了保護我這個本來就沒多少時間的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我不甘心。我們的性命全都被人利用了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我不甘心......這最後一刻的生命，這一點不屬於我，這是他們所有人用血去換來的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "這一點點生命.......我必須交給值得信任的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "謝謝你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": ".......啊......即使活下來了，又有哪裡可去呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我們本就沒有其它地方可去。我們熟悉的從來就只有那片雪原而已。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "龍門並不是烏薩斯。渴望著拯救同胞和感染者，想要去找一處又溫暖，又有糧食，還有住處的地方......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "不該是龍門。自一開始，就不該是龍門。龍門的市民也在苦苦尋求自己的生活。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我們唯一該回去的，就只有烏薩斯......我們的祖國......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "雪......靜靜的河水......搖曳的松林......碧綠的苔衣......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "這片大地，多麼美好啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以，你認為塔露拉是操縱了這一切的人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......如果我猜的沒錯......陰謀已經蓄勢待發。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "就算博卓卡斯替老爺子能拖上一時，塔露拉既然敢這樣謀劃，就一定有對付他的辦法。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "龍門沒有出手的機會......而烏薩斯也會袖手旁觀。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "但你們還在，感染者還有機會。哪怕只有一點點——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "——去毀掉現在的塔露拉。中止她的瘋狂，不要讓整合運動再吞噬更多感染者了。整合運動不需要塔露拉，任何一個塔露拉都不需要......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "或者......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......我的一點點私心。去拯救她。不。去幫助她。和我們那無數的感染者同胞一起......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "那個真正的......走在泥濘土地上的......塔露拉......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "霜星小姐？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "你......說。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我認為你父親是真的愛你的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "就像你記得你的親生父母為你而死。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你清楚地記著你父親為你所做的一切。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我又怎麼會不知道呢？只是，我要死在他之前了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "如果他從來沒撿到我，那會有多好。那樣，他就不會因我感到痛苦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "他已經受了那麼多的苦......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "正因為他受過很多苦，所以他才珍惜你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "呵呵......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我可以這麼叫你吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "羅德島的博士。在這片大地上，選擇也許沒有意義。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "即使這樣，即使結果沒有區別......我也想自己去選。我做出選擇了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "用我自己的手......去擦拭我結出的果。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "霜星的手指摸索著你的面龐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......你的手指，是暖的？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "奇怪。你的臉......很冰。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我的體溫......沒有那麼低了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是。你的病徵消失了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "很溫暖，霜星。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......在死前......我終於又和人相碰了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "霜星，阿米婭和我都希望你加入羅德島。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我真有這種資格？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "僅僅是普通地死去，就沒有時間再去改正錯誤。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......不給出答覆是不禮貌的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "告訴阿米婭，Dr.{@nickname}......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "在這片大地上，僅憑一個人，是什麼也做不到的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "但她絕對不是一個人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "現在開始，我在你身邊。我在你們身邊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我......願意加入羅德島。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "謝謝你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "不。是我......謝謝你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "你的眼神......和我一位舊識，很像。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我遇見過一個男孩，他說他的哥哥寧願上絞架也不願改變觀點去迎合敵人的寬恕......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "所以他要走過雪原，他要踏遍烏薩斯.......所以他沒有和我們一起走。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我以為那已經是我見過最理想化的人了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "只是，你和阿米婭讓我覺得……也許理想也可以成為一種信念。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "羅德島就是為了共同的信念而戰的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "原本整合運動......也是一樣的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "真像啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "你的眼神，和那個孩子，真的很像。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "只不過，你沒他那麼堅定，但卻比他......溫柔太多了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
